OL,3,GNEWSANurse with stoma to run 100-mile
OL,4,Aultramarathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse is preparing to take on a
OL,7,F100-mile ultramarathon to raise funds
OL,8,Ffor a specialist stoma service which
OL,9,Fhas supported her while she lives with
OL,10,FCrohn's disease.
OL,12,FEmma Raynes, who works at Leighton
OL,13,FHospital in Crewe, Cheshire, lives with
OL,14,Fa stoma provided by the trust running
OL,15,Fthe site, and has already completed two
OL,16,Fultra marathons this year ` covering
OL,17,Fdistances of 30 miles (48 km) and 52
OL,18,Fmiles (83 km).
OL,20,FShe will have raced more than 180 miles
OL,21,Fin total when she completes her latest
OL,22,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
